### Actualizar cliente
POST {{baseUrl}}/Customer/Save
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerName": "CEMACO",
  "privateCode": "CENACO-TEST",
  "membership": {
    "organizationId": 229
  }
}

